<<<
2 (as nn.). For the name of the Scotch dialect, the noun Scottish is little used; Scotch is the English noun, & Scots the usual Scotch noun.
===
**2** (as nn.). For the name of the Scotch dialect, the noun *Scottish* is little used; *Scotch* is the English noun, & *Scots* the usual Scotch noun.
>>>

